# CODEOWNERS — auto-requests review from listed owners on PRs touching these paths.
# Combined with branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners", this makes
# silent reverts of these areas (PRs that delete/rename files at these paths
# without your explicit approval) impossible to land via auto-merge.
#
# Background: PR #1383 silently reverted PR #1384's wallet/(tabs) cleanup via
# a 3-way merge that resolved a rename/modify conflict by keeping the old
# paths. Auto-merge then squash-merged the result. CODEOWNERS would have
# required explicit review on the (tabs) edits before that could land.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2>...
# Patterns follow gitignore semantics. Order matters: later rules override earlier.

# --- Storefront route tree (Expo Router auto-routes anything in here) ---
/apps/mobile-storefront/app/(tabs)/         @ogabasseyy
/apps/mobile-storefront/app/_layout.tsx     @ogabasseyy
/apps/mobile-storefront/proxy.ts            @ogabasseyy

# --- Web proxy / middleware (auth, CSRF, rate limiting, custom domains) ---
/apps/web/src/proxy.ts                      @ogabasseyy
/apps/web/src/middleware.ts                 @ogabasseyy

# --- Database migrations (append-only, must not be re-ordered) ---
/supabase/migrations/                       @ogabasseyy

# --- Payments, webhooks (real money paths) ---
/apps/web/src/app/api/payments/             @ogabasseyy
/apps/web/src/app/api/webhooks/             @ogabasseyy

# --- Build / CI / branch protection config ---
/.github/                                   @ogabasseyy
# Privileged reviewer workflow: pin upgrades follow the manual SARIF-audit
# procedure in .github/muse-code-review.md — owner review must confirm
# that procedure on every PR touching this file.
/.github/workflows/muse-code-review.yml    @ogabasseyy
/turbo.json                                 @ogabasseyy
/vercel.json                                @ogabasseyy
